<p>11/7/2023 Update:<br />
We now have a Discord server set up for discussion of this site. The link is below, feel free to join and contribute!<br />
<a href="https://discord.gg/5RfjSXKGg4">https://discord.gg/5RfjSXKGg4</a></p>
<p>Original Post:<br />
What do you all think of setting up a Discord server for discussions on this page? I'm asking because the spam on here is getting out of control and I'm only a moderator so the best I can do is move the spam to the deleted topics folder. I try and check it at least once a day, but if I miss a day or two it's a good 10 minute task to clear the 2-3 pages of crap.</p>
<p>At this point, I don't think the page owner is going to be coming back and from what I've read it's pretty difficult/impossible to take control of a wikidot page from an absent owner.</p>
<p>I know I'm not as active on here as I used to be, real life gets in the way unfortunately. I'll keep this topic pinned so it doesn't get buried.</p>

